---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "~/self.config";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Copyright Notice"
    description="Copyright notice last updated: 2025-05-05"
    locale="en"
>
    <div class="legal-container">
        <h1>Copyright Notice</h1>

        <h2>Copyright Agreement</h2>

        <p>
            To maintain article quality, preserve the open sharing spirit of the
            internet, and ensure stable page traffic, all original articles on
            this site are licensed under the
            <a
                href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a
            > license. This page aims to clearly explain the licensing standards and
            requirements for reasonable use of articles on this site.
        </p>

        <p>
            This site has no advertising or commercial behavior. Violating the
            license will not only harm the original author's enthusiasm but also
            affect the overall copyright environment. We strongly encourage you
            to abide by the license when sharing content. Following the license
            will almost never negatively impact your goals - encouraging a
            creative environment is every creator's expectation.
        </p>

        <h2>Which Articles Are Covered?</h2>

        <p>
            All original content is indicated at the top of the article title
            and in the copyright notice section at the end of each article.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong
                    >Non-commercial redistribution of original content</strong
                >: Must be redistributed in full with the source URL clearly
                marked or a hyperlink to the original article.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>As reference material</strong>: No need to redistribute
                in full, but source must be credited.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What You Can Do</h2>

        <p>
            As long as you follow this license, you are free to share article
            content - in any medium, in any format, for any purpose, without
            notifying the author.
        </p>

        <h2>What You Cannot Do</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Commercial use</strong>: You may not use the content for
                commercial purposes.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Modifications</strong>: You may not distribute modified
                versions or derivative works.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
            If you have any questions about this copyright notice, please
            contact: qlad_adgk@163.com
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .legal-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-container h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--title-color);
    }

    .legal-container h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--title-color);
    }

    .legal-container p {
        color: var(--body-color);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-container a {
        color: var(--link-color);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-container a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .legal-container ul {
        color: var(--body-color);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-container li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>
